{
  "id": "GEN.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Mwanzo 29",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aliendelea na safari yake, akafika katika nchi za watu wa mashariki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja akaona kisima mbugani, na kando yake makundi matatu ya kondoo wamepumzika. Kondoo walikuwa wananyweshwa kutoka kisima hicho kilichokuwa kimefunikwa kwa jiwe kubwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kawaida, makundi yote ya kondoo yalipokusanyika, wachungaji walivingirisha hilo jiwe kwa pamoja toka kisimani na kuwanywesha kondoo. Halafu walikifunika tena kisima kwa jiwe hilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akawauliza wachungaji, “Ndugu zangu, mmetoka wapi?” Wakamjibu, “Tumetoka Harani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akawauliza, “Je, mnamfahamu Labani mwana wa Nahori?” Wakamjibu, “Tunamfahamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaendelea kuwauliza, “Je, hajambo?” Nao wakamjibu, “Hajambo; hata binti yake Raheli, yule kule anakuja na kondoo wake!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Yakobo akawaambia, “Naona bado ni mchana, na si wakati wa kuwakusanya kondoo pamoja. Basi, wanywesheni kondoo maji, mwende mkawachunge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wao wakamwambia, “Hatuwezi kufanya hivyo mpaka makundi yote yawe yamekusanyika pamoja, na jiwe limevingirishwa kisimani, ndipo tuwanyweshe kondoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo alipokuwa bado anazungumza na hao wachungaji, Raheli akafika na kondoo wa baba yake, kwani ndiye aliyekuwa akiwachunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo alipomwona Raheli, bintiye Labani, kaka ya mama yake, na alipowaona kondoo wa Labani, mjomba wake, akaenda na kulivingirisha lile jiwe kwenye mdomo wa kisima, akalinywesha maji kundi la Labani, mjomba wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Yakobo akambusu Raheli na kulia kwa sauti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Yakobo akamjulisha Raheli kuwa yeye ni wa jamaa ya baba yake, na kwamba ni mwana wa Rebeka. Raheli akapiga mbio nyumbani akamwarifu baba yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aliposikia habari za Yakobo, mpwa wake, alikwenda mbio kumlaki, akamkumbatia, akambusu, akamkaribisha nyumbani kwake. Yakobo akamsimulia Labani mambo yote yaliyotokea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Labani akasema, “Hakika, wewe ni jamaa yangu, damu moja nami!” Yakobo akakaa naye kwa muda wa mwezi mmoja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja Labani alimwambia Yakobo, “Wewe ni jamaa yangu lakini hiyo haimaanishi kwamba utanitumikia bure. Niambie unataka ujira kiasi gani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa, Labani alikuwa na binti wawili: Mkubwa aliitwa Lea, na mdogo aliitwa Raheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea alikuwa na macho dhaifu, lakini Raheli alikuwa mzuri wa umbo na wa kupendeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo alimpenda Raheli; kwa hiyo akamwambia Labani, “Nitakutumikia miaka saba ili unioze Raheli, binti yako mdogo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani akamwambia, “Afadhali nimwoze Raheli kwako wewe kuliko kumwoza mtu mwingine yeyote. Endelea kuishi nami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yakobo akamtumikia Labani miaka saba kwa ajili ya Raheli, lakini kwake muda huo ulikuwa kama siku chache, kwa vile alivyompenda Raheli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Yakobo akamwambia Labani, “Muda wangu umetimia, kwa hiyo nipe mke wangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Labani akaandaa karamu na kuwaalika watu wote wa huko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini jioni, Labani akamchukua Lea, binti yake mkubwa, na kumpeleka kwa Yakobo. Yakobo akalala naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Labani akamtoa Zilpa, mjakazi wake, awe mtumishi wa Lea.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asubuhi, Yakobo akagundua ya kuwa ni Lea! Basi, akamwuliza Labani, “Umenitendea jambo gani? Je, si nilikutumikia kwa ajili ya Raheli? Mbona basi, umenidanganya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani akamjibu, “Nchini mwetu hatufanyi hivyo; si desturi yetu kumwoza binti mdogo kabla ya mkubwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtimizie Lea siku zake saba, nasi tutakupa Raheli kwa utumishi wa miaka saba mingine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akakubali. Na Yakobo alipomtimizia Lea siku zake saba, Labani akampa Raheli, binti yake mdogo awe mke wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Labani akamtoa Bilha, mjakazi wake, awe mtumishi wa Raheli). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yakobo akalala na Raheli pia. Lakini Yakobo akampenda Raheli kuliko Lea; akamtumikia Labani miaka mingine saba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
